# Report Bug — {{ project_name }}

Structured bug reporting protocol. Facts only — no speculation, no fix suggestions.
Use this skill when a `failed_scenario` verdict is recorded during manual execution,
or when visual debugging confirms an app defect.

## When to invoke

- A test case returns `failed_scenario` (the AC is correct; the app is wrong)
- Manual reproduction confirms the defect exists independent of the test
- A regression is found in an existing feature during a QA session

**Do NOT invoke before manual reproduction.** A failing assertion alone is not a bug.

